A||||13||mrfixit58||Pisa Dash||||14
Z||000000||mrfixit58||10-11-1999||02:16 PM||||Has anyone tried the Pisa replacement dash for their Fiero or seen installed? It looks great in pictures and reminds me of the Corvette dash. I think the $1000 price tag is a little much but may be willing to addd it anyway if I decide to go full custom on my GT. Any thoughts?||||reg||14
Z||000001||ChadMan||10-11-1999||03:13 PM||||While in Phoenix this past summer, I stopped by PISA's shop and saw the dash installed in an Artero.  It was really nice, and had a rich look and feel.<P>But I remember thinking that it was awfully expensive.  My Fiero would have to go, stop and turn flawlessly before I could justify spending that kind of jack on a dash!||||reg||1
Z||000002||mrfixit58||10-11-1999||04:09 PM||||Chadman,<P>Yea, your right. The one knock on the Fiero to me is the dash. It always seemed very plain, almost generic. A fresh dash like Pisa's would really jazz it up. ||||reg||1
